    "body": "Fixed by PR #3818 (merge `7f4915a6d`, #3747). Round a part, the rings of a level now stay at depth and link in the plane. Each remaining lift has a named reason. The pins: `ring_links::start_side_rings_do_not_lift`, `ring_links::dogbone_start_side_lifts`, `ring_links::lift_reason_is_named`, and the heavy pin `lifts::fig8_start_sides_lift_only_with_a_named_reason`.",
